# A New Dawn (jeuno 62): Sturm's death reads the var. A BST 75 with A New Dawn accepted and the var 4 (GM) at the first
# Sarcophagus: the three NMs popped; the var set 3 (GM); Sturm killed: the var stays 3 (its script despawns Taifun and
# Trombe).
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolis pos=-410.4,6.5,503.0 job=BST lvl=75
quest Jeuno.ANewDawn accepted
charvar ANewDawn_Event 4
login
trigger Sarcophagus                     # accepted, the first, the var 4: Sturm, Taifun, Trombe popped; no event
charvar ANewDawn_Event 3
kill STURM                              # accepted, the var 3: nothing (the var stays 3); Taifun and Trombe despawned
